Files the IOC tree carries in data/ that are neither built nor tuned: DM
screen display lists (.dl), dm launch scripts, test files and LUT_edit.py.

Copied from production /gemini/GEM8.6/gmos/gmos -> V7-16/data on 2026-11-13.
capfast/adl cannot regenerate the .dl files on Linux yet, so the RPM installs
these as they are. Where a file also exists elsewhere in this repo (adl/,
test/) and differs, the copy here is production's and is the one installed.

Tuned files (*.lut, *.pv) are not here: they live in the gmoscc-config
submodule and are never owned by the RPM.
